      "cancel": [],
      "conversion": "MixinSquared @TargetHandler + MixinExtras @WrapOperation on the EnhancedBeardifierHelper.computeDensity call inside Integrated API's Beardifier compute handler (intapi_calculateDensity): per block the call runs on views of Integrated API's two adaptation lists that hold only the terms whose kernel reaches the block, swapped into the two slots for the call; with no term in reach the value is returned without the call (helper bons.furious.patch.integratedapi_c49.IapiBounds). Needs the armed Beardifier census of worldgen_empty_beardifier_marker (bons.furious.patch.beardifier.EmptyBeardifiers, by reflection): Integrated API 1.9.1's BeardifierMixin and EnhancedBeardifierHelper are byte-identical to the 1.8.2 builds it verifies.",
